# Render Speechless: a hand holding only lands has no nonland card to choose, so Bot1 is asked nothing (the refused Choose) and
# nothing is discarded; the counters are put on the creature all the same, as the spell still resolves in full.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Render Speechless
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Render Speechless.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
